"This is how your notes look: <b>bold</b>, <i>italic</i>, <u>underlined</u> "
"and <s>struck through</s>."
msgstr ""
"Voici à quoi ressemblent vos notes : <b>gras</b>, <i>italique</i>, "
"<u>soulignées</u> et <s>barrées</s>."

